sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in S.C.No.199/2024 pending before the Court of Principal District & Sessions Judge, Chitradurga, arising out of Crime No.238/2024 registered by Challakere Police Station, Chitradurga District, for the offences punishable under Sections 114, 417, 420, 376(2)(n) read with 34 of IPC, subject to the following conditions:
a) Petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
NC: 2025:KHC:10541 b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future;
e) The petitioner shall not leave the jurisdiction of the Trial Court without permission of the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
Sd/-
(S VISHWAJITH SHETTY) JUDGE KK Kumarswamy G vs The State By Challakere on 12 March, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/194862045/
